{
  "closeIdle": "<p>Closing <strong>VT-TEST-0001</strong> for <strong>this client</strong> ends the office's work on it in ViTally. Its open document requests and office tasks are cancelled; their titles, reasons, notes and received documents stay exactly as they are.</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>This does not cancel, withdraw or amend any return filed elsewhere, and it changes nothing at any tax authority. The client is told the office closed the application, in words that fit the reason. They never see your note.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><fieldset class=\"close-reasons\"><legend>Why the office is closing this case</legend><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-out_of_scope\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-out_of_scope\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"out_of_scope\" required><span>Out of scope</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-no_need_to_file\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-no_need_to_file\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"no_need_to_file\" required><span>No need to file</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-duplicate\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-duplicate\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"duplicate\" required><span>Duplicate</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-dismissed\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-dismissed\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"dismissed\" required><span>Dismissed (client unreachable)</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-withdrawn\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-withdrawn\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"withdrawn\" required><span>Withdrawn</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-other\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-other\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"other\" required><span>Other</span></label></fieldset><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-close-close-note\"><span>Note for staff (required for Other)</span><textarea id=\"field-close-close-note\" name=\"close-note\" maxlength=\"1000\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-close-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>I understand this closes the case for everyone.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"CLOSE_CASE\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 5 14 14M5 19 19 5\"/></svg> Close this case</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it open</button>",
  "closeBusy": "<p>Closing <strong>VT-TEST-0001</strong> for <strong>this client</strong> ends the office's work on it in ViTally. Its open document requests and office tasks are cancelled; their titles, reasons, notes and received documents stay exactly as they are.</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>This does not cancel, withdraw or amend any return filed elsewhere, and it changes nothing at any tax authority. The client is told the office closed the application, in words that fit the reason. They never see your note.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><fieldset class=\"close-reasons\"><legend>Why the office is closing this case</legend><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-out_of_scope\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-out_of_scope\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"out_of_scope\" required><span>Out of scope</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-no_need_to_file\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-no_need_to_file\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"no_need_to_file\" required><span>No need to file</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-duplicate\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-duplicate\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"duplicate\" required><span>Duplicate</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-dismissed\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-dismissed\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"dismissed\" required><span>Dismissed (client unreachable)</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-withdrawn\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-withdrawn\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"withdrawn\" required><span>Withdrawn</span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-close-reason-other\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-close-close-reason-other\" name=\"close-reason\" value=\"other\" required><span>Other</span></label></fieldset><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-close-close-note\"><span>Note for staff (required for Other)</span><textarea id=\"field-close-close-note\" name=\"close-note\" maxlength=\"1000\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-close-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-close-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>I understand this closes the case for everyone.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"CLOSE_CASE\" disabled><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 5 14 14M5 19 19 5\"/></svg> Close this case</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it open</button>",
  "readyToEfile": "<p>Mark <strong>VT-TEST-0002</strong> for <strong>Mei Chen</strong> as ready to e-file?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>The client will be told PCDC recorded that their return is ready. This can't be undone.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-ready-efile-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-ready-efile-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>The client signed Form 8879, or the return will be given to the client on paper.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"MARK_READY_TO_EFILE\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg> Mark ready to e-file</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it as it is</button>",
  "efiledNameless": "<p>Mark <strong>VT-TEST-0003</strong> for <strong>this client</strong> as e-filed?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>The client will be told how their return was filed, in the words beside your choice. This can't be undone.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-both_efile\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-both_efile\" name=\"filing-combination\" value=\"both_efile\" required><span>Both returns e-filed<br><small class=\"muted\">The client will be told: PCDC e-filed your return.</small></span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-efile_and_paper\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-efile_and_paper\" name=\"filing-combination\" value=\"efile_and_paper\" required><span>Federal e-filed, Pennsylvania on paper (given to the client to mail)<br><small class=\"muted\">The client will be told: PCDC e-filed your federal return and gave your Pennsylvania return on paper to you or the person you sent. If it isn&#39;t signed yet, sign it, then mail it yourself. A reply can take about 3 months after you mail it.</small></span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-paper_and_efile\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-paper_and_efile\" name=\"filing-combination\" value=\"paper_and_efile\" required><span>Federal on paper (given to the client to mail), Pennsylvania e-filed<br><small class=\"muted\">The client will be told: PCDC gave your federal return on paper to you or the person you sent, and e-filed your Pennsylvania return. If the federal return isn&#39;t signed yet, sign it, then mail it yourself. A reply can take about 3 months after you mail it.</small></span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-both_paper\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"field-efiled-filing-combination-both_paper\" name=\"filing-combination\" value=\"both_paper\" required><span>Both returns on paper (given to the client to mail)<br><small class=\"muted\">The client will be told: PCDC gave your returns on paper to you or the person you sent. If they aren&#39;t signed yet, sign them, then mail them yourself. A reply can take about 3 months after you mail them.</small></span></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-efiled-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-efiled-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>Each return was e-filed, or given to the client on paper, as chosen above.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"MARK_EFILED\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg> Mark e-filed</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it as it is</button>",
  "recordFilingResult": "<p>Record the filing result for <strong>VT-TEST-0004</strong> for <strong>Mei Chen</strong>?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>Each e-filed return is recorded as accepted or rejected, with its date. A return left on No answer yet stays as it is. A rejection moves the case to Rejected at once. This can't be undone.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><fieldset class=\"filing-return\"><legend>Federal return (e-filed)</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-result-federal\"><span>Answer</span><select id=\"field-filing-result-federal\" name=\"result-federal\"><option value=\"\">No answer yet</option><option value=\"accepted\">Accepted</option><option value=\"rejected\">Rejected</option></select></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-date-federal\"><span>Date of the answer</span><input id=\"field-filing-date-federal\" name=\"date-federal\" type=\"date\" value=\"\" max=\"TODAY\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-code-federal\"><span>Reject code (only if rejected)</span><input id=\"field-filing-code-federal\" name=\"code-federal\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" maxlength=\"40\"></label></fieldset><fieldset class=\"filing-return\"><legend>Pennsylvania return (e-filed)</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-result-state\"><span>Answer</span><select id=\"field-filing-result-state\" name=\"result-state\"><option value=\"\">No answer yet</option><option value=\"accepted\">Accepted</option><option value=\"rejected\">Rejected</option></select></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-date-state\"><span>Date of the answer</span><input id=\"field-filing-date-state\" name=\"date-state\" type=\"date\" value=\"\" max=\"TODAY\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-code-state\"><span>Reject code (only if rejected)</span><input id=\"field-filing-code-state\" name=\"code-state\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" maxlength=\"40\"></label></fieldset><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-filing-fix-note\"><span>Fix note (only when a return is rejected): what needs fixing in TaxSlayer</span><textarea id=\"field-filing-fix-note\" name=\"fix-note\" maxlength=\"1000\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-filing-result-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-filing-result-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>These results are correct.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"RECORD_FILING_RESULT\" data-stage=\"efiled\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg> Record the result</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it as it is</button>",
  "returnToSigning": "<p>Return <strong>VT-TEST-0005</strong> for <strong>Mei Chen</strong> to signing?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>The client will be told: PCDC corrected your return. You need to sign it again. This can't be undone.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-return-to-signing-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-return-to-signing-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>The fix is done.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"RETURN_TO_SIGNING\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg> Return to signing</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it as it is</button>",
  "requestDocuments": "<p>Ask <strong>Mei Chen</strong> for documents on <strong>VT-TEST-0006</strong>?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>The client sees each title and message and sends the documents themselves. The case waits at Waiting for documents until you verify every one. The client is told which documents PCDC asked for.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><fieldset class=\"request-row\"><legend>Document 1</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-title-1\"><span>Short title</span><input id=\"field-ask-request-title-1\" name=\"request-title-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" required maxlength=\"120\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-message-1\"><span>What the client should send</span><textarea id=\"field-ask-request-message-1\" name=\"request-message-1\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset class=\"request-row\"><legend>Document 2 (optional)</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-title-2\"><span>Short title</span><input id=\"field-ask-request-title-2\" name=\"request-title-2\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" maxlength=\"120\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-message-2\"><span>What the client should send</span><textarea id=\"field-ask-request-message-2\" name=\"request-message-2\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset class=\"request-row\"><legend>Document 3 (optional)</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-title-3\"><span>Short title</span><input id=\"field-ask-request-title-3\" name=\"request-title-3\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" maxlength=\"120\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-message-3\"><span>What the client should send</span><textarea id=\"field-ask-request-message-3\" name=\"request-message-3\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset class=\"request-row\"><legend>Document 4 (optional)</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-title-4\"><span>Short title</span><input id=\"field-ask-request-title-4\" name=\"request-title-4\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" maxlength=\"120\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-message-4\"><span>What the client should send</span><textarea id=\"field-ask-request-message-4\" name=\"request-message-4\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset class=\"request-row\"><legend>Document 5 (optional)</legend><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-title-5\"><span>Short title</span><input id=\"field-ask-request-title-5\" name=\"request-title-5\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" maxlength=\"120\"></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-ask-request-message-5\"><span>What the client should send</span><textarea id=\"field-ask-request-message-5\" name=\"request-message-5\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></label></fieldset><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"REQUEST_DOCUMENTS_AT_INTAKE\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H5v18h14V8l-5-5Zm0 0v6h5M8 13h8M8 17h5\"/></svg> Ask for these documents</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it as it is</button>",
  "putOnHold": "<p>Put <strong>VT-TEST-0007</strong> for <strong>Mei Chen</strong> on hold?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>Use this when the office cannot reach the client. The client is told PCDC is trying to reach them. Your note stays with staff.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-hold-hold-note\"><span>Note for staff (optional)</span><textarea id=\"field-hold-hold-note\" name=\"hold-note\" maxlength=\"1000\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></label><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-hold-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-hold-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>I understand the case goes on hold.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"PUT_ON_HOLD\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8v5l3 2M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg> Put on hold</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it as it is</button>",
  "resumeFromHold": "<p>Record that the office got in touch with <strong>Mei Chen</strong> about <strong>VT-TEST-0008</strong>?</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>The case goes back to the stage it was on before the hold. The client is told PCDC is working on their application again.</p></div><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"checkbox-row\" for=\"field-resume-confirmed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"field-resume-confirmed\" name=\"confirmed\" value=\"true\" required><span>The office got in touch with the client.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"RESUME_FROM_HOLD\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 3H4c-1 8 9 18 17 17v-4l-5-2-2 2-6-6 2-2-3-5Z\"/></svg> Got in touch</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep it on hold</button>",
  "corrections": "<p>Tell the preparer what to correct in TaxSlayer. The client never sees these words.</p><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-corrections-findings\"><span>Corrections to send back to the preparer</span><textarea id=\"field-corrections-findings\" name=\"findings\" required maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"4\"></textarea></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"REQUEST_CORRECTIONS\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 5-7 7 7 7M7 12h13\"/></svg> Send back for corrections</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep reviewing</button>",
  "correctionsRetry": "<div class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" id=\"corrections-error\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg><div><h3>This case changed while you were working</h3><p>This case changed.</p><div class=\"conflict-choices\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn secondary\" data-action=\"retry-action\" >Try again</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"dismiss-error\" >Dismiss</button></div></div></div><p>Tell the preparer what to correct in TaxSlayer. The client never sees these words.</p><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-corrections-findings\"><span>Corrections to send back to the preparer</span><textarea id=\"field-corrections-findings\" name=\"findings\" required maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"4\" aria-describedby=\"corrections-error\"></textarea></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"REQUEST_CORRECTIONS\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 5-7 7 7 7M7 12h13\"/></svg> Send back for corrections</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep reviewing</button>",
  "correctionsRefused": "<div class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" id=\"corrections-error\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg><div><h3>That did not go through</h3><p>Not allowed.</p><div class=\"conflict-choices\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"dismiss-error\" >Dismiss</button></div></div></div><p>Tell the preparer what to correct in TaxSlayer. The client never sees these words.</p><form class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-corrections-findings\"><span>Corrections to send back to the preparer</span><textarea id=\"field-corrections-findings\" name=\"findings\" required maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"4\" aria-describedby=\"corrections-error\"></textarea></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-case-action=\"REQUEST_CORRECTIONS\" ><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 5-7 7 7 7M7 12h13\"/></svg> Send back for corrections</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep reviewing</button>",
  "reset": "<p>This rebuilds the 6 sample cases and the sample request for help with forms. They get new Application IDs, so any sample case open in another window is replaced.</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Zm-4 9 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><p>Applications this class created stay exactly as they are, and so do every sign-in, every volunteer persona and the office's own settings. Nobody is emailed.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-action=\"confirm-reset-fixtures\" >Reset the sample cases</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep them as they are</button>",
  "checkpoint": "<p>This puts one sample case back to a chosen point in the story. It keeps its Application ID and its client, and replaces the work recorded on it.</p><form id=\"checkpoint-form\" class=\"staff-form\"><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-checkpoint-caseId\"><span>Sample case</span><select id=\"field-checkpoint-caseId\" name=\"caseId\" required><option value=\"\">Select an option</option><option value=\"sample-0\" >VT-SAMP-0000 · Draft</option><option value=\"sample-1\" >VT-SAMP-0001 · Draft</option><option value=\"sample-2\" >VT-SAMP-0002 · Draft</option><option value=\"sample-3\" >VT-SAMP-0003 · Draft</option><option value=\"sample-4\" >VT-SAMP-0004 · Draft</option><option value=\"sample-5\" >VT-SAMP-0005 · Draft</option></select></label><label class=\"field\" for=\"field-checkpoint-checkpoint\"><span>Point in the story</span><select id=\"field-checkpoint-checkpoint\" name=\"checkpoint\" required><option value=\"\">Select an option</option><option value=\"intake_ready\" >Waiting for a preparer</option><option value=\"document_requested\" >Waiting on a document</option><option value=\"admin_followup_needed\" >Waiting for a call from the office</option><option value=\"ready_for_review\" >Waiting for a reviewer</option><option value=\"corrections_required\" >Sent back for corrections</option></select></label><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg><p>The records it writes are simulated, and the case's history says so. Nothing is filed, signed or sent.</p></div><button type=\"submit\" id=\"checkpoint-submit\" class=\"btn primary full\">Load this checkpoint</button></form><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Leave this case as it is</button>",
  "checkpointEmpty": "<p>There are no sample cases in this workspace yet.</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg><p>Reset the sample cases first; that is what creates them.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-action=\"open-reset-fixtures\" >Reset the sample cases</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Close</button>",
  "regenerateEn": "<div class=\"modal-backdrop\"><section class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"modal-title\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button class=\"close-btn\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 5 14 14M5 19 19 5\"/></svg></button><span class=\"overline\">ViTally · HERE TO HELP</span><h2 id=\"modal-title\">Replace the fictional answers?</h2><p>This replaces every answer in this form with a different fictional example, including answers you edited. Your email address, Application ID and current stage do not change.</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg><p>Nothing is saved until you save the form, so you can still step back through the form and check it first.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-action=\"confirm-regenerate\" >Replace with another example</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep my answers</button></section></div>",
  "regenerateZh": "<div class=\"modal-backdrop\"><section class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"modal-title\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button class=\"close-btn\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" aria-label=\"关闭对话框\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 5 14 14M5 19 19 5\"/></svg></button><span class=\"overline\">ViTally · 随时为您提供帮助</span><h2 id=\"modal-title\">要替换虚构的回答吗？</h2><p>这会用另一组虚构示例替换此表格中的所有回答，包括您修改过的回答。您的电子邮箱、申请编号和当前阶段都不会改变。</p><div class=\"info-note\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5M12 17h.01M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0\"/></svg><p>在您保存表格之前，不会保存任何内容，所以您仍然可以先回头检查表格。</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-action=\"confirm-regenerate\" >换成另一组示例</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >保留我的回答</button></section></div>",
  "leaveAddCase": "<div class=\"modal-backdrop\"><section class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"modal-title\" tabindex=\"-1\"><button class=\"close-btn\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\"><svg class=\"icon \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 5 14 14M5 19 19 5\"/></svg></button><span class=\"overline\">ViTally · HERE TO HELP</span><h2 id=\"modal-title\">Leave without saving?</h2><p>The answers on this page are not saved yet. If you leave now, they are lost. Nothing has been sent to the office.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn primary full\" data-action=\"confirm-leave-add-case\" >Leave and discard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn text\" data-action=\"close-dialog\" >Keep editing</button></section></div>"
}
